.u-tokai.ac.jp/examination-admissions/","verification_status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-15","updated_at":"2026-08-15","history_summary":"1942年の創立・源流を経て、1950年に現在の大学として開学しました。","admissions_url":"https://www.u-tokai.ac.jp/examination-admissions/","admissions_status":"active","academic_field_tags":["文学・人文","法学","経済・経営・商学","社会学","教育","体育・スポーツ","国際関係","観光","理学","工学","情報・AI","医学","看護・医療","海洋","農学"],"feature_summary":"全国のキャンパスに23学部62学科・専攻を擁する総合大学で、人文社会、教育・スポーツ、理工、医療、海洋、農学まで幅広い分野を横断して学べます。","founded_year":1942,"opened_year":1950,"founder":"松前重義","operator":"学校法人東海大学","university_goal":"幅広い視野と柔軟な創造性を備え、自ら考え、多様な人々と協働しながら、明日の歴史を担う強い使命感と豊かな人間性を持つ人材を育成することを目指します。","philosophy":"創立者松前重義の教育思想を基盤に、思想・体躯・智能・希望を育み、人類の幸福と平和に資する『調和のとれた文明社会』の建設を目指します。","student_counts":{"total":30428,"as_of":"2025"},"sources":[{"source_name":"東海大学 監査根拠","source_url":"https://www.u-tokai.ac.jp/examination-admissions/","verified_at":"2026-08-15","role":"primary"},{"source_name":"東海大学 沿革","source_url":"https://www.u-tokai.ac.jp/about/philosophy-history/history/","verified_at":"2026-08-15","role":"primary"},{"source_name":"東海大学 建学の精神","source_url":"https://www.u-tokai.ac.jp/about/philosophy-history/spirit/","verified_at":"2026-08-15","role":"primary"},{"source_name":"東海大学 理念・憲章","source_url":"https://www.u-tokai.ac.jp/about/philosophy-history/concept/","verified_at":"2026-08-15","role":"primary"}]},{"id":"u000051","name":"東京医科大学","status":"active","lifecycle_status":"current","establishment_type":"private","university_type":"university","prefecture":"東京都","municipality":"新宿区","headquarters":{"prefecture":"東京都","municipality":"新宿区","address":"東京都新宿区新宿6-1-1","postal_code":"160-8402"},"official_url":"https://admissions-tokyo-med.jp/","verification_status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-15","updated_at":"2026-08-15","history_summary":"1916年の創立・源流を経て、1946年に現在の大学として開学しました。","admissions_url":"https://admissions-tokyo-med.jp/","admissions_status":"active","academic_field_tags":["医学","看護・医療"],"feature_summ